                               ## 🧠 Problem-Solving Approach

                               For every problem, I aim to follow this process:

                               1. Understand the problem
                               2. Think of a brute-force approach
                               3. Identify the pattern
                               4. Find an optimized solution
                               5. Analyze time and space complexity
                               6. Implement the solution in Java
                               7. Test the solution
                               8. Revisit difficult problems later

