                               ## 🔥 Rules

                               * Don't blindly copy solutions
                               * Try solving problems independently first
                               * Focus on understanding the pattern
                               * Keep solutions clean and readable
                               * Record important approaches and tricks
                               * Revisit problems that were difficult
                               * Stay consistent

